# 基础词 Unit 28 短语

## 常考短语

- **economic stability**: 经济稳定 — The government aims to maintain economic stability. 政府旨在维护经济稳定。
- **meet the standard**: 达到标准 — All products must meet the safety standard. 所有产品必须达到安全标准。
- **stimulate economic growth**: 刺激经济增长 — Tax cuts can stimulate economic growth. 减税可以刺激经济增长。
- **adopt a strategy**: 采取策略 — The company adopted a new strategy for growth. 公司采取了新的增长策略。
- **under stress**: 在压力下 — People make poor decisions under stress. 人们在压力下会做出糟糕的决定。
- **submit to**: 屈服于 — She refused to submit to pressure. 她拒绝屈服于压力。
- **substitute A for B**: 用A代替B — You can substitute olive oil for butter. 你可以用橄榄油代替黄油。
- **a subtle difference**: 微妙的区别 — There is a subtle difference in meaning. 含义上有微妙的区别。
- **sum up**: 总结 — To sum up, the project was a success. 总之，这个项目是成功的。
- **be superior to**: 优于 — This method is superior to the old one. 这个方法优于旧方法。
- **supplement...with**: 用…补充 — She supplemented her diet with vitamins. 她用维生素补充饮食。
- **survive on**: 靠…生存 — He survived on very little money. 他靠很少的钱生存。
- **suspect sb of**: 怀疑某人 — The police suspected him of fraud. 警方怀疑他欺诈。
- **suspend...from**: 暂停 — The company suspended him from work. 公司暂停了他的工作。
- **sustainable development**: 可持续发展 — Sustainable development is crucial for the future. 可持续发展对未来至关重要。
